  "<p>Kalsa runs a private AI on your own computer. Your messages are answered on this computer; when Kalsa searches the web, the words of that search leave it. Your phone talks to this computer. This page gets you installed and through the first start. It is written for non-technical testers — you don't need to know how anything works.</p>",
  "<h2 id=\"requirements\">1. What you need</h2>",
